<title>CANADA: Videotron closes sale of British unit.</title>
<headline>Videotron closes sale of British unit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Le Groupe Videotron Ltee said on Tuesday that it closed the sale of its British cable subsidiary for cash proceeds of about US$607 million.</p>
<p>In the transaction, which was announced on October 22, Videotron sold its British unit, which held a 56 percent interest in Videotron Holdings Plc, to Bell Cablemedia Plc for cash proceeds of US$19.75 for each American Depository Receipt.</p>
<p>Videotron said the sale received the necessary approvals and will lower the company's debt.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
